    "updated_at": "2022-04-25T21:55:13Z",
    "body": "> This is wrong and breaks backward compatibility.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if it breaks backward compatibility. A page used a new feature (`blocking=render`) and got a new behavior (dynamic render-blockingness that can change over time).\r\n\r\nNow, it might be the case that that new behavior is not _desired_. But I don't think it's a _compat issue_.\r\n\r\nDo you agree?",
